comment.narrative:
Representation of women in Armenia:
- 33% in the National Assembly; 
- 12% in the Government as Ministers  (1 out of 12);
- 23% among Deputy Ministers (10 out of 43);
- 10% among Governors (1 out of 10);
- At the local level, the representation of women raised to 31% (cumulatively, with quota applied) in 45 communities where local elections were held in 2021.
